	ate\, 90-minute presentation of world-class illusions\, magic-themed cockt
	ails\, and 5-star hospitality—for 4 shows over 2 Saturdays. \nA 2025 TripA
	dvisor Travellers’ Choice Award winner\, the touring show founded by Austr
	alian celebrity magician Christopher Wayne is also ranked among TripAdviso
	r’s top 10% of experiences worldwide. \nAdmission\nTickets are $79\; $69 p
	er person for a group of 8. Order tickets or learn more. \n \nWhen you pla
	ce an order following links to Fever\, you’re supporting 365 Houston at no
	 extra cost to you. We may receive a small commission from Fever from any 
	purchase you make. \nLearn more about advertising your event\, business\, 
	product or service.\n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/theatre-of-
	magic-at-the-jw-marriott-houston-downtown-5a/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in 
