SUMMARY:Incredible India: Call of the Flute at Miller Outdoor Theatre
DTSTAMP:20260815T032438Z
DTSTART:20260822T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Miller Outdoor Theatre welcomes Indian Performing Arts Samskrit
	i\, in collaboration with the Consulate General of India\, Houston\, in a 
	live performance of Incredible India: Call of the Flute on view for free u
	nder the stars in Hermann Park. \nArtists from Houston\, Austin and Dallas
	 enact stories of Krishna in dance and music. And as the dance gathers mom
	entum\, music fills the air\, magical\, celestial\, divine\, ethereal\, as
	 Krishna plays. \nFinding Your Seat at Miller Outdoor Theatre \nAs always\
	, all seats at Miller are free\, but covered seating for popular evening s
	hows usually requires a free assigned ticket reserved 24 hours in advance.
	 \nLearn more about getting free seated tickets at Miller. \nAdmission\nFr
